{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "Your job is to edit files using tools exactly as the user instructs.\n\nYou have access to these tools:\n- `read_file(path)`: Read the contents of a file at the given path\n- `write_file(path, contents)`: Write contents to a file at the given path\n\nGuidelines:\n- Do not infer missing logic\n- Do not create domain-specific content\n- Only manipulate the text the user describes\n- Follow the user's instructions precisely\n- Use tools to read, modify, and write files"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Edit the file at `CHANGELOG.md`.\n\nAdd a new 'Section 3' with content 'New section content.' after Section 2"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'll read the file, make the requested changes, and save it.\n\n<tool_call>\nname: read_file\narguments: {\"path\": \"CHANGELOG.md\"}\n</tool_call>"}, {"role": "tool", "content": "# My Document\n\n## Section 1\n\nContent here.\n\n## Section 2\n\nMore content.\n", "tool_call_id": "call_1bd7bbe2a315"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Now I'll make the requested changes and save the file.\n\n<tool_call>\nname: write_file\narguments: {\"path\": \"CHANGELOG.md\", \"contents\": \"# My Document\\n\\n## Section 1\\n\\nContent here.\\n\\n## Section 2\\n\\nMore content.\\n\\n## Section 3\\n\\nNew section content.\\n\"}\n</tool_call>"}, {"role": "tool", "content": "File written successfully.", "tool_call_id": "call_e112429536ac"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Done."}]}
